# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client samples. Run top to bottom.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenant = tenant-a

### Health with dependency status
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Index a new document
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "title": "Distributed search architecture",
  "content": "Elasticsearch shards the inverted index; Redis caches hot queries.",
  "tags": ["architecture", "search"],
  "metadata": {"category": "engineering", "year": 2024}
}

### Search (assignment contract)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=distributed%20search&tenant={{tenant}}

### Search with facets, filters, sort and highlighting
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=search&facets=tags,metadata.category&filter=category:engineering&sort=newest&page=1&page_size=10
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}

### Typo-tolerant search (fuzzy=auto falls back to fuzzy only when exact finds nothing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=distibuted
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}

### Retrieve document details
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{create.response.body.id}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}

### Tenant isolation: another tenant gets 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{create.response.body.id}}
X-Tenant-ID: tenant-b

### Remove a document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{create.response.body.id}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}

### Bulk index
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/bulk
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"documents": [
  {"title": "Caching strategy", "content": "Redis keeps distributed search responses fast.", "tags": ["performance"]},
  {"title": "Incident review", "content": "Circuit breakers stopped a cascading failure.", "tags": ["operations"]}
]}

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
